        "text": "The target is the seasonally adjusted total nonfarm job openings level in BLS JOLTS Table 1, measured on the last business day of September. All historical anchors below use this same variant and each month's original preliminary print; archived Table A Total reports the same concept. The official November calendar at https://www.bls.gov/schedule/2026/11_sched.htm schedules September JOLTS for November 3, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. Eastern, also confirmed by the current JOLTS release. Resolution retains the registered strict first-print policy."
