        "tool": "official.lookup",
        "call": "Fetch April and May original preliminary seasonally adjusted Total levels from https://www.bls.gov/news.release/archives/jolts_06022026.htm and https://www.bls.gov/news.release/archives/jolts_06302026.htm; inspect April's industry explanation.",
        "result": "April 2026: 7,618 thousand; May: 7,594 thousand, or 7.618 and 7.594 million. April's contemporaneous reported increase was 731,000, including professional and business services +668,000 and finance and insurance -135,000. That within-release change uses revised March data."
      },
      {
