      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The reference class is eight monthly first prints from January through August 2026. Their mean is 7.201875 million. Six of seven successive changes were negative, while their mean change was +0.019 million because April rose sharply. The outside-view level prior is persistence at August's 7.079 million; historical change dispersion sets uncertainty before current-month adjustments."
      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
        "tool": "official.lookup",
        "call": "Fetch the September 2026 Employment Situation summary released October 2 at https://www.bls.gov/news.release/empsit.nr0.htm.",
